[l_english.STATE_LORE_217]
The Narrow Gate, the eastern border of the Kirin commune, is the border between Kirins, Unicornia, and the Abyssinia desert. Because both neighboring countries are as closed as we used to be, there is almost no lively trade or tourists at the border here — except for a short period of time a few years ago.
It was the year before Applejack and Fluttershy visited the Kirin commune. The villagers of the Narrow Gate accidentally discovered a rich high-quality crystal mine in a cave near the Narrow Gate, making this small village a hot topic in the entire Eastern Region. Many Kirins left their hometown to the Narrow Gate to become miners, and with them came the few gem merchants in the Kirin commune. The Narrow Gate seemed to become lively overnight, but this liveliness only lasted for a short period of time — a mine collapse caused by an earthquake ended this craze. After Rain Shine intervened, she realized that the mine structure here was very fragile and prone to mining accidents, so she forcibly closed all the mines, and the crystal craze of that year came to an end.

[l_english.STATE_LORE_217_0]
Culanika Lokadhātu, a small village once known as the Narrow Gate. Before the Ultimate Battle, it was discovered that there was a rich high-quality crystal mine here, making this small village a hot topic in the entire Eastern Region. But what is even more bizarre... in a mine, a miner accidentally discovered a portal connecting two worlds, now known as the “Culanika Lokadhātu”.
Informed of the existence of another world, Rain Shine quickly took over the area and began to cooperate with the Kirin commune on the other side. Unfortunately, the attempts at peace and cooperation ultimately failed. The climate of that world is colder than here, and their homeland were eventually devoured by the Windigo. As a result, they had to cross the Narrow Gate and migrate to this world. The question now is, will they be welcomed?

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_217]
狭关，麒麟社群的东部边境，与阿比西尼亚沙漠和独角兽仙境的交界处。由于这两个邻国都也像我们曾经那样封闭，所以这里的边境几乎没有什么热闹的贸易或是游客 —— 除了几年之前的一小段时间。
在苹果嘉儿与柔柔访问麒麟社群的前一年，狭关的村民无意间在狭关旁的山洞中发现了丰富的高品质水晶矿，让这座小村庄突然间成为了整个东部地区的热门话题。许许多多的麒麟离开家乡到狭关寻找机会成为了矿工，与他们一同而来的还有那时麒麟社群里本就不多的宝石商。狭关似乎一夜之间变得热闹起来，但这种热闹也只持续了一小段时间 —— 一场地震导致的矿洞坍塌终结了这一热潮。雨晴介入后，意识到这里的矿洞结构非常脆弱，很容易发生矿难，强制封锁了所有矿洞，当年的水晶热潮也就此结束。
狭关回到了那个不起眼的小村庄，但所有麒麟都知道那些水晶就在那里，吸引着每一位愿意为财富铤而走险的麒麟冒险者。

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_217_0]
千界之门，一个曾经名为“狭关”的小村庄。在终末之战前的，这里曾经被发现有着丰富的高品质水晶矿，让这座小村庄突然间成为了整个东部地区的热门话题。但更加诡异的是... 在一处矿洞内，一名矿工无意间发现了连通两个世界的传送门，如今被称为“千界之门”。
得知另一个世界的存在，雨晴很快接管了这一地区，并开始与对面的麒麟社群合作。只可惜，和平与合作的尝试最终还是失败了。那个世界的气候比这里更加寒冷，最终那个世界的麒麟被风之魔吞噬了家园，而他们则不得不举族跨越狭关，迁徙到这个世界来。他们，会受到欢迎吗？
